{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33975","headline":"怀华阳润卿博士三首 三 · 皮日休","name":"怀华阳润卿博士三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤骨轻来称瘦容，华阳馆主未成翁。\n数行玉札存心久，一掬云浆漱齿空。\n白石煮多熏屋黑，丹砂埋久染泉红。\n他年欲事先生去，十赉须加陆逸冲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33975.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33975","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}